  "title": "Clearance Vaporizers (taxes extra)",
  "description": "CLEARANCE / LIQUIDATION / VAPORIZERS\nTAXES ARE EXTRA, PRICES ARE IN CANADIAN DOLLAR\n\nBoundless Vaporizers:\nBoundless CFV (older stock, good vapor, limited battery)\nBoundless Vexil (good vapor, newer units, affordable\n\nVapir Prima:\nVapir Prima full kit at a low price\n90 day warranty\n\nMagic Flight:\nMagic Flight Maud-Dib Concentrate Kits.\nA classic wooden box portable vaporizer at a great price!\n\nThe Terp Timer by Octave is a desktop wireless thermal sensor unit that enables precise temperature control of concentrate sessions. Simply set your desired temperature, heat up your banger, and place the Terp Timer directly underneath the banger using the laser sensor for alignment. The Terp Timer beeps to remind you when your banger reaches the chosen temperature.\n\nAll our clearance section vaporizers carry a 15 day warranty unless specified otherwise. They will either be replaced with equivalent units or you will be given credit towards a new vaporizer.\n\nExchange policy: We will take any vaporizer back for credit towards an upgrade for a new vaporizer within 14 days of purchase.\n\nIf you have any questions or need any details about our liquidation vaporizers, email sales@vaporizers.ca",
  "description_html": "<p><strong>CLEARANCE / LIQUIDATION / VAPORIZERS<br />TAXES ARE EXTRA, PRICES ARE IN CANADIAN DOLLAR</strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://admin.shopify.com/store/vaporizers-ca/collections/44261244979\"><strong>Boundless Vaporizers:</strong></a><br />Boundless CFV (older stock, good vapor, limited battery)<br />Boundless Vexil (good vapor, newer units, affordable</p>\n<p><strong>Vapir Prima:<br /></strong><a href=\"https://vaporizers.ca/collections/vapir-prima-vaporizer\" title=\"Vapir Prima\">Vapir Prima</a> full kit at a low price<br />90 day warranty<strong></p>\n<p>Magic Flight:<br /></strong><a href=\"https://vaporizers.ca/products/maud-dib-concentrate-box-kit\" title=\"Magic Flight Maud-Dib Concentrate Box\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Magic Flight Maud-Dib Concentrate Kits</a>.<br />A classic wooden box portable vaporizer at a great price!</p>\n<p><strong>The Terp Timer by Octave</strong> is a desktop wireless thermal sensor unit that enables precise temperature control of concentrate sessions. Simply set your desired temperature, heat up your banger, and place the Terp Timer directly underneath the banger using the laser sensor for alignment. The Terp Timer beeps to remind you when your banger reaches the chosen temperature.<br /><strong></strong></p>\n<p><strong>All our clearance section vaporizers carry a 15 day warranty unless specified otherwise.</strong><strong> They will either be replaced with equivalent units or you will be given credit towards a new vaporizer. </p>\n<p>Exchange policy: We will take any vaporizer back for credit towards an upgrade for a new vaporizer within 14 days of purchase.<br /></strong><br /><strong>If you have any questions or need any details about our liquidation vaporizers, email sales@vaporizers.ca</strong></p>",
